WEBVTT

00:20:58.238 --> 00:21:01.345
Teie oletegi ju need, 
kes neid tegema hakkavad?

00:21:01.705 --> 00:21:02.414
Just.

00:21:02.644 --> 00:21:04.655
Linus Torvalds, aitäh sulle Linuxi eest,

00:21:04.655 --> 00:21:06.395
aitäh sulle Interneti eest

00:21:06.395 --> 00:21:09.015
aitäh kõikide Androidi 
telefonide eest.

00:21:09.015 --> 00:21:11.035
Aitäh, et tulid TEDile ja 
endast rääkisid.

00:21:11.035 --> 00:21:12.395
Aitäh sulle!

00:21:12.933 --> 00:21:16.933
(Aplaus)